WEBVTT

00:00:04.215 --> 00:00:06.467
♪ We're gonna get funky, funky ♪

00:00:06.551 --> 00:00:08.844
-("Cha Cha Slide" by DJ Casper playing)
-(cheering)

00:00:08.928 --> 00:00:10.513
Oh, yeah.

00:00:10.596 --> 00:00:13.099
♪ Everybody, clap your hands ♪

00:00:13.182 --> 00:00:16.727
-♪ Clap, clap, clap, clap your hands ♪
-(rhythmic clapping)

00:00:16.811 --> 00:00:19.313
♪ Clap, clap, clap, clap your hands ♪

00:00:19.397 --> 00:00:21.482
♪ All right, now,
we're gonna do the basic step ♪

00:00:21.566 --> 00:00:22.692
♪ To the left ♪

00:00:22.775 --> 00:00:24.277
♪ Take it back now, y'all ♪

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:26.445
♪ One hop this time ♪

00:00:26.529 --> 00:00:28.281
♪ Right foot, let's stomp ♪

00:00:28.364 --> 00:00:30.241
-♪ Left foot, let's stomp ♪
-(whoops)

00:00:30.324 --> 00:00:32.285
-♪ Cha-cha real smooth ♪
-Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm.

00:00:32.368 --> 00:00:33.911
Check it out.

00:00:33.995 --> 00:00:35.788
♪ Turn it out ♪

00:00:35.871 --> 00:00:37.623
♪ To the left ♪

00:00:37.707 --> 00:00:39.208
♪ Take it back now, y'all ♪

00:00:39.292 --> 00:00:41.168
♪ One hop this time ♪

00:00:41.252 --> 00:00:42.920
-♪ Right foot, let's stomp ♪
-(moaning)

00:00:43.004 --> 00:00:44.338
♪ Left foot, let's stomp ♪

00:00:44.422 --> 00:00:46.215
♪ Cha-cha now, y'all ♪

00:00:46.299 --> 00:00:48.926
-(grunting)
-♪ Now it's time to get funky ♪

00:00:49.010 --> 00:00:50.636
♪ To the right now... ♪

00:00:50.720 --> 00:00:53.389
Okay. That worked.

00:00:53.472 --> 00:00:54.640
♪ One hop this time... ♪

00:00:54.724 --> 00:00:56.851
Now you just have to get
your thoughts together

00:00:56.934 --> 00:00:58.853
before you run into... (gasps)

00:00:58.936 --> 00:00:59.979
Ericka!

00:01:00.062 --> 00:01:02.523
Uh, what happened up there?

00:01:02.607 --> 00:01:04.275
Oh. (stammers) Wh-What?

00:01:04.358 --> 00:01:05.610
What was that, sweetheart?

00:01:05.693 --> 00:01:08.029
The music-- it is so booming.

00:01:08.112 --> 00:01:09.947
Oh, yeah, feel it, baby.

00:01:10.031 --> 00:01:11.032
Drac!

00:01:11.115 --> 00:01:12.491
Whew, that was close.

00:01:12.575 --> 00:01:14.952
-Mavis!
-A new restroom?

00:01:15.036 --> 00:01:16.037
Really, Dad?

00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:18.205
That was the big surprise?

00:01:18.289 --> 00:01:21.250
There wasn't anything else
you were gonna announce?

00:01:21.334 --> 00:01:22.376
Like what?

00:01:22.460 --> 00:01:26.797
Like-- I don't know-- your retirement.

00:01:26.881 --> 00:01:28.257
What?! Uh...

00:01:28.341 --> 00:01:29.508
(stammers)

00:01:29.592 --> 00:01:32.762
Oh! Listen to those, uh,
dope-tastic beats.

00:01:32.845 --> 00:01:35.348
-Uh, shake a leg, honeybat.
-Dad, wait!

00:01:35.431 --> 00:01:36.432
(panting)

00:01:37.516 --> 00:01:40.353
Oh, man, this is all my fault.

00:01:40.436 --> 00:01:43.481
I ruined everything,
all because I'm not a monster.

00:01:43.564 --> 00:01:46.359
So you want to become a monster, huh?

00:01:46.442 --> 00:01:47.485
Van Helsing?

00:01:47.568 --> 00:01:49.487
I can help with that.

00:01:49.570 --> 00:01:52.782
I've got just the thing down in my lab.

00:01:54.283 --> 00:01:55.910
The question is:

00:01:55.993 --> 00:01:58.579
Where did I put it?

00:01:58.663 --> 00:02:00.956
Whoa.

00:02:01.040 --> 00:02:04.043
♪ ♪

00:02:04.126 --> 00:02:05.127
Ooh.

00:02:05.211 --> 00:02:06.796
It's all organized very unique--

00:02:06.879 --> 00:02:08.673
-Don't touch anything!
-Sorry.

00:02:08.756 --> 00:02:10.091
Not there.

00:02:10.174 --> 00:02:11.342
-Whoa.
-Ah, that's not it.

00:02:11.425 --> 00:02:13.094
It must be in the back somewhere.

00:02:13.177 --> 00:02:15.805
-(gasps)
-Come on, hurry up!

00:02:15.888 --> 00:02:17.723
Right through here.

00:02:21.560 --> 00:02:23.187
(grunts)

00:02:23.270 --> 00:02:25.189
Keep up! Yeah!

00:02:26.148 --> 00:02:27.483
(straining)

00:02:27.566 --> 00:02:29.652
Alley-oop!

00:02:29.735 --> 00:02:31.821
-Whoa.
-(whoops)

00:02:34.740 --> 00:02:36.909
I know it's around here somewhere.

00:02:37.993 --> 00:02:39.328
(grunts)

00:02:39.412 --> 00:02:40.538
Hello?

00:02:40.621 --> 00:02:42.331
(grunts) Van Helsing?

00:02:42.415 --> 00:02:43.958
Aha!

00:02:44.041 --> 00:02:46.085
(singsongy):
Found it!

00:02:46.168 --> 00:02:48.754
Behold, the Monsterfication Ray.

00:02:48.838 --> 00:02:51.966
It turns any human into a monster.

00:02:52.049 --> 00:02:53.467
Awesome!

00:02:53.551 --> 00:02:54.885
But is it safe, though?

00:02:54.969 --> 00:02:56.053
Great question.

00:02:56.137 --> 00:02:58.973
What we need is a guinea pig.

00:02:59.056 --> 00:03:00.474
Meet Gigi.

00:03:02.351 --> 00:03:04.770
Aw. She's so cute.

00:03:04.854 --> 00:03:06.272
Not for long.

00:03:08.065 --> 00:03:09.233
♪ ♪

00:03:09.316 --> 00:03:11.527
(electricity crackling)

00:03:15.656 --> 00:03:17.408
(chuckles):
Whoa!

00:03:17.491 --> 00:03:19.660
Sign me up for teeth like these.

00:03:19.744 --> 00:03:23.205
Ooh, and seven eyes
and laser vision and...

00:03:23.289 --> 00:03:25.166
Oh, it doesn't work that way.

00:03:25.249 --> 00:03:29.044
Who knows what sort of
hideous beast you'll become?

00:03:29.128 --> 00:03:30.713
So let's find out.

00:03:30.796 --> 00:03:32.089
Don't worry, Mavis.

00:03:32.173 --> 00:03:34.592
This is gonna fix everything.

00:03:34.675 --> 00:03:36.677
Lay it on me, bro!

00:03:39.680 --> 00:03:40.681
Huh?

00:03:43.017 --> 00:03:44.810
Huh, that's weird.

00:03:44.894 --> 00:03:46.020
Nothing happened.

00:03:46.103 --> 00:03:48.022
-(grunts)
-(stomach gurgling)

00:03:48.105 --> 00:03:50.566
(groans) I don't feel so good.

00:03:50.649 --> 00:03:52.526
No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no.

00:03:52.610 --> 00:03:55.613
(shouting, grunting)

00:03:56.530 --> 00:03:57.656
Huh?

00:04:00.409 --> 00:04:03.078
(shouting, grunting)

00:04:05.247 --> 00:04:07.291
Uh-oh.

00:04:07.374 --> 00:04:08.542
(screams)

00:04:08.626 --> 00:04:10.961
(snarling)

00:04:12.046 --> 00:04:13.672
(roaring)

00:04:13.756 --> 00:04:15.966
("Bidibodi Bidibu (Satollo Mix)"
by Bubbles playing)

00:04:17.384 --> 00:04:18.511
Dad?

00:04:19.637 --> 00:04:20.805
Drac?

00:04:20.888 --> 00:04:22.515
(stammering)

00:04:27.311 --> 00:04:29.438
Honey? Sweetheart?

00:04:29.522 --> 00:04:30.648
Dad?

00:04:32.358 --> 00:04:33.901
Whew.

00:04:33.984 --> 00:04:36.278
(Johnny growling in distance)

00:04:38.280 --> 00:04:39.990
What is that?

00:04:44.870 --> 00:04:47.122
-(Johnny grunting)
-(objects clatter)

00:04:49.166 --> 00:04:51.544
(Johnny growling)

00:04:51.627 --> 00:04:53.420
Hello?

00:04:53.504 --> 00:04:56.131
Van Helsing?

00:04:56.215 --> 00:04:57.758
Is everything okay down here?

00:04:57.842 --> 00:04:58.968
-(loud squeak)
-Huh?

00:04:59.051 --> 00:05:00.636
(squeaking)

00:05:01.679 --> 00:05:03.597
(Johnny snarling)

00:05:03.681 --> 00:05:05.474
Hello?

00:05:05.558 --> 00:05:07.643
Who's there?

00:05:11.146 --> 00:05:12.857
(objects clattering)

00:05:12.940 --> 00:05:14.900
♪ ♪

00:05:20.698 --> 00:05:22.533
Hey, Drac, what's up?

00:05:22.616 --> 00:05:24.618
Wha-- uh, Johnny?

00:05:24.702 --> 00:05:26.203
Yeah, it's me.

00:05:26.287 --> 00:05:27.955
Whoa! (grunts)

00:05:29.456 --> 00:05:31.125
I'm a monster.

00:05:31.208 --> 00:05:34.879
Check out these big feet
and these claws-- ooh--

00:05:34.962 --> 00:05:37.006
and these ears-- they're so pointy.

00:05:37.089 --> 00:05:39.133
And, look, I've got a tail!

00:05:39.216 --> 00:05:40.551
-(laughs)
-(grunts)

00:05:40.634 --> 00:05:42.720
Why-- (stammers)

00:05:42.803 --> 00:05:44.763
Why did you-- How did you...

00:05:44.847 --> 00:05:47.641
I used Van Helsing's monster ray.

00:05:47.725 --> 00:05:49.727
Now you can give the hotel
to Mavis and me,

00:05:49.810 --> 00:05:50.895
just like you wanted.

00:05:50.978 --> 00:05:52.771
(gasps) Oh, my gosh. Mavis!

00:05:52.855 --> 00:05:54.940
She's gonna love the new me.
Let's go show her!

00:05:55.024 --> 00:05:56.525
Whoa, whoa, whoa, wait, wait, wait.

00:05:56.609 --> 00:05:58.235
-Mavis?
-(grunts)

00:05:58.319 --> 00:06:00.154
(singsongy):
Mavis?

00:06:01.906 --> 00:06:03.240
(grunts, gasps)

00:06:03.324 --> 00:06:06.201
Oh, no. Mavis is going to kill me.

00:06:08.329 --> 00:06:10.539
Mavis! Mavis?

00:06:10.623 --> 00:06:12.207
I'll fix that!

00:06:12.291 --> 00:06:13.292
Mavis!

00:06:13.375 --> 00:06:15.294
I got great news!

00:06:16.378 --> 00:06:17.630
Got ya!

00:06:19.465 --> 00:06:20.466
(groans)

00:06:20.549 --> 00:06:22.593
(panting)

00:06:22.676 --> 00:06:23.677
(grunting)

00:06:28.557 --> 00:06:30.559
-Ooh, pardon me.
-(moaning)

00:06:31.644 --> 00:06:32.645
What?

00:06:32.728 --> 00:06:34.605
I-I can't believe it.

00:06:34.688 --> 00:06:36.815
The nightmare-- it's over!

00:06:36.899 --> 00:06:38.525
I'm human again!

00:06:39.568 --> 00:06:41.111
Huh?

00:06:41.195 --> 00:06:42.404
(moans sadly)

00:06:43.489 --> 00:06:45.950
I better be careful.
There are monsters everywhere.

00:06:46.033 --> 00:06:47.201
(panting)

00:06:47.284 --> 00:06:48.285
Oh, excuse me.

00:06:48.369 --> 00:06:49.787
-Coming through.
-No, no, no, no, no!

00:06:49.870 --> 00:06:51.413
(groans)

00:06:51.497 --> 00:06:52.748
Mavis?

00:06:56.168 --> 00:06:58.712
(grunting, straining)

00:07:00.422 --> 00:07:01.882
(sighs)

00:07:01.966 --> 00:07:03.175
Mavis?

